.TH OPENDOOR 1 "May 2026" "OpenDoor 5.16.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
opendoor \- web directory and subdomain scanner
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B opendoor
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
OpenDoor is a terminal-based web reconnaissance tool for authorized security testing.
It supports directory discovery, subdomain enumeration, fingerprinting, WAF detection,
proxy-aware scans, response sniffers, session workflows, and multiple report formats.
.SH OPTIONS
Run
.B opendoor --help
to view the full command-line reference.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B opendoor --host https://example.com --scan directories
.PP
.B opendoor --host https://example.com --fingerprint --waf-detect
.SH AUTHOR
Stanislav WEB
.SH SEE ALSO
Project documentation: https://opendoor.readthedocs.io
